		"The real flight time is DOT's record of the same month a year earlier (November 2025, all 305 flights flown), since the trip's own month hasn't happened. That month included the FAA's flight cuts during the federal shutdown, so it ran worse than usual: 5.6% cancelled, against 0.3% and 1.5% in the two Novembers before.",
